SY_TALK("mCQZC3bq_yQ",[[2,["Today we are celebrating the resurrection","of Christ."]],[8,["With it we have to also celebrate","the resurrection of human beings,"]],[15,["of Sahaja Yogis who have been resurrected","as realised souls."]],[24,["With that we have to understand that","we enter into a new awareness."]],[33,["There was no need for Christ to enter","into any new awareness,"]],[39,["He had to come down and again to show","to this world"]],[44,["that you are the eternal life, that you","lead a life"]],[56,["that is spiritual, which never perishes."]],[61,["You have to rise into that new realm"]],[67,["which is the realm of God Almighty,"]],[75,["what you call ‘The Kingdom of God’."]],[78,["And He said it very clearly to Nicodemus","that, “You are to be born again.”"]],[89,["And when he asked, “Am I to enter back","into my mother’s womb to be born again?”"]],[96,["But He said it so clearly! It’s so clear."]],[98,["Those who don’t want to see can remain","blind!"]],[103,["But he said it very very clearly that,","“No,” that is,"]],[109,["“whatever is born of the flesh is","the flesh,"]],[114,["but whatever is born of the Spirit","is the Spirit.”"]],[122,["I mean, nothing could be more clear","than that,"]],[125,["that it has to be born of the Spirit."]],[131,["Of course, human beings have a special","capacity to twist everything around."]],[137,["For them Spirit could be a book, could be","some words,"]],[141,["could be an organisation, a church,"]],[143,["or some sort of a thing like that which","they have made."]],[147,["But whatever is man-made is not the Spirit,"]],[153,["this is the clear statement of Christ,","which people wanted to avoid"]],[158,["and start their own organisations,","their own ideas"]],[165,["and created a very mythical thing","in His name."]],[171,["And now the time has come for it","to be blasted."]],[178,["It has been going on and on for thousands","of years,"]],[182,["captured so many innocent people,","and people are into it."]],[189,["But when you are resurrected, when you","become realised souls,"]],[196,["one has to understand that now your","movement is inward,"]],[206,["you are moving towards your roots","and not outside."]],[210,["So whatever was the endeavour before","realisation"]],[220,["has to be changed, the direction has","to be changed,"]],[225,["and that point mostly we miss."]],[231,["This is the thing, today, [that] I am","trying to explain to you."]],[237,["That, so far, to a human mind entertainment","was important; entertaining."]],[247,["To the mind, not to the Spirit."]],[251,["Entertainment to the Spirit is absolutely","opposite to the entertainment to the mind."]],[262,["Like somebody the other day telephoned","to me and said that,"]],[268,["“Mother, there is no excitement","in Sahaja Yoga.”"]],[279,["The excitement is too much."]],[284,["We are going against that."]],[289,["We are going towards peace, not towards","excitement"]],[293,["and this kind of electric-shocks that we","require every time."]],[297,["You see, a drunkard – he’s all right in","the morning but evening-time he goes off,"]],[303,["he needs a shock, a, some sort","of an injection into his body."]],[309,["All human enterprises have been like that.","They are to excite your body."]],[317,["Because if it is the dead you are dealing","with, then you have to excite it."]],[324,["But something that is living, that is","eternal,"]],[328,["you have to enjoy it and not to excite it."]],[332,["So the direction has to be juxtaposition,"]],[339,["and that is where many Sahaja Yogis","fail to understand."]],[346,["How do we do it? Is the point."]],[350,["How do we make our attention move inward","instead of going outward?"]],[359,["If you start from the time you are born","again, it is much easier,"]],[368,["because it’s a new venture into [which]","you go in."]],[372,["That is the peace, peace of your Spirit,","the joy of your Spirit,"]],[379,["which is permanent, you don’t need","any excitement from it,"]],[382,["it is permanent, it is eternal."]],[389,["So the first thing that comes to our mind","is that whatever we do"]],[396,["before realisation we have not to do."]],[403,["The first and foremost thing is [that]","realisation comes to you effortlessly."]],[409,["So the effort which is built in your body","all the time, the energy of effort,"]],[415,["“I must do this, I must do that, I have","to do this, I have to do that!”"]],[419,["That creates tension, that I have told you","already."]],[423,["So what do we do?"]],[428,["We do not try to compete with others."]],[440,["We do not try to fix certain timings,","dates, watches."]],[454,["We do not also put our attention"]],[460,["into any endeavour which puts us","into effort,"]],[467,["but we relax that attitude of effort."]],[473,["It’s called as, in Sanskrit, prayatna","shaithilya."]],[476,["For a western mind it’s very difficult","to grasp the subject so try to understand."]],[485,["That doesn’t mean lethargy, doesn’t","mean lethargy."]],[490,["One should never confuse with the dead,","the energy of the living."]],[498,["Now we are trying to transform our energies","towards the energy of the Spirit."]],[508,["So you have to allow the Spirit","to take over."]],[514,["Your effort of your mind should be reduced"]],[519,["and the energy of the Spirit should work","through you."]],[524,["Now how do you do it?"]],[531,["First is detachment, detachment."]],[540,["Detachment start with the thought, let us","see the thought."]],[546,["It’s called as vichara shaithilya –","relaxation of the thought."]],[551,["Now a thought is coming into your mind,","some thought [like],"]],[555,["“Today is Mother’s puja, let’s go. We have","to hurry up.” You see, “Must get this,"]],[560,["you didn’t get the flowers, now you go","to the Third World and get the flowers."]],[564,["You must get this and you must get that”"]],[567,["Second [thought] is: “No. Detach yourself."]],[576,["Witness. Leave it to the Spirit. Watch.”"]],[584,["You’ll get it. Many of you have noticed","this."]],[589,["But still this mind, which is quite silly,","tries to impress upon you"]],[595,["that you have to use the old junky","instrument of this mind."]],[604,["And it asserts that “Better use.” And when","you start using that,"]],[609,["ego comes in, you get attached to it,"]],[615,["and what you lose is your progress","and thus the joy is minimised."]],[622,["How do you detach yourself?"]],[627,["For a person who is absolutely detached","is very difficult"]],[630,["to explain how to detach, isn’t it?"]],[635,["I’ll try! Now. I cannot get attached.","That’s the problem is."]],[646,["And I find it difficult to explain to you","in words which are human words,"]],[651,["but still, I’ll try to say now."]],[658,["Say, I tried something as human beings do,","in the beginning,"]],[662,["just to see how it works out; because I had","to experiment."]],[666,["For example, when I had to, say, attend","any puja or anything,"]],[673,["I used to ask them, “What is the auspicious","time?”"]],[681,["So they would tell me, “This is","the auspicious time.”"]],[684,["And then another would telephone to say,","“This is the auspicious time.”"]],[688,["So I said, “How can there be two auspicious","times?”, you see,"]],[690,["[it’s a] big problem with human beings."]],[692,["So they said, “There are 5 Panchangas","in India.”"]],[697,["Means 5 books to consult the auspicious","time."]],[701,["That’s what human beings have done.","I said, “Then why consult?"]],[705,["It’s better not to have 5 auspicious times,","isn’t it?”"]],[710,["Then the auspicious time has to be","beyond time."]],[718,["But it is bound in the time the way human","beings have made it,"]],[723,["so it is bound in the time. Like in India,","it is so much, so much, so much,"]],[728,["but now, here (in London) it’s different.","Then you calculate, you have a watch."]],[733,["You see, to overcome all these hurdles","human beings also make certain devices."]],[738,["So you consult. “Now what is the auspicious","time here?” – leave at that time."]],[746,["Then it’s a big headache because there are","5 books to be consulted,"]],[753,["watch could be wrong, this could be wrong,","that could be so."]],[758,["But if you are the Spirit, then the Spirit","works out auspiciousness."]],[765,["It is the Spirit that works out","the auspiciousness."]],[769,["And imagine when you think like that,","how much tension goes out."]],[774,["First of all you have to be a slave","of the watch;"]],[777,["another, you have to be the slave","of the books,"]],[779,["then you have to be the slave","of the market,"]],[784,["of the room, of the place which you have","to hire."]],[790,["But supposing if you allow the Spirit","to work it out,"]],[796,["then everything will work out. And you","will reach at the point"]],[801,["when it is the most auspicious."]],[804,["So how do you accept it? Just by accepting."]],[811,["So, just now if you give up your satta,","your own domain,"]],[818,["you get into the domain of your Spirit."]],[823,["You give up your domain, that is your","ego’s domain,"]],[829,["or may be your super-ego’s domain.","You give up that"]],[833,["and try to see things how it works out."]],[839,["Now, what is the testing point of it?","How do you test it?"]],[845,["It works out. That’s the point of testing."]],[852,["It works out. Allow it to work out."]],[857,["Don’t put your attention."]],[860,["Attention [word] has the second part of,","is the ‘tension’."]],[865,["And don’t try to say, “Why not today,","it should have happened today,"]],[870,["we expected it to happen. Why not","at this moment?”"]],[875,["That’s your ego. “Thy will be done”."]],[883,["So the thought that starts moving","in our mind"]],[892,["all the time, which creates tensions is not","the thought of the Spirit."]],[898,["So, what you should say [is], “Not this","thought. Not this thought.”"]],[904,["“Ya neti, neti wachane nigamor awachus”"]],[907,["“Not this thought, not this thought,","not this thought”,"]],[912,["and see how you relax. Now you are","relaxing -"]],[915,["“Not this thought, not this thought”."]],[918,["Just go on refusing accepting any thought."]],[923,["So you go into Nirvichara. In that state","you feel the Spirit."]],[931,["Christ has done the greatest work on this,","I should say, but we do not understand"]],[936,["because His life was like a micro-thing,","you see, 3 years."]],[943,["So we have to open it out a little bit","and see what He did."]],[948,["He has given us the greatest weapon","of forgiveness."]],[953,["When you forgive a person, what do you do?"]],[959,["You accept the situation, to begin with,","and secondly you forgive"]],[968,["what you think has been done wrong to you."]],[972,["But because nothing can be done wrong","to your Spirit,"]],[978,["you just forgive, because you are","the Spirit!"]],[983,["And when you forgive, you have found","that your tension goes away."]],[990,["So even to your thoughts if you say,","“All right, forgive this thought,"]],[994,["forgive this thought,” because thought is","also not to be punished."]],[1000,["“Forgive this thought, forgive this","thought, forgive everything.”"]],[1004,["Not forget, forgive:"]],[1009,["because then you will even forget that","you are the Spirit!"]],[1016,["But “forgive all the thoughts that","are coming to me.”"]],[1020,["Just go on saying this, is a mantra.","What is a mantra?"]],[1025,["Is that power of the word that expresses","Spirit."]],[1034,["So this is a very important thing Christ","has given us:"]],[1038,["the weapon of forgiveness. Everybody","has that weapon,"]],[1043,["everyone can use that weapon. You don’t","have to put in any effort for it,"]],[1049,["you don’t have to pay for it, it’s just you","have to say, “I forgive.”"]],[1055,["You’ll be amazed your nerves will soothe","down, this tension,"]],[1061,["this pressure of these modern things","will be reduced"]],[1069,["if you go on saying, “I forgive, I forgive","them”."]],[1073,["For example, you go and see some sort of a…"]],[1078,["I mean, if you happen suddenly to see","something very filthy"]],[1082,["according to the Spirit."]],[1085,["Maybe it is very exciting according","to normal human beings,"]],[1089,["but we are abnormal people and for us","if we find it rather ugly"]],[1096,["then the best thing is, to get over,","is to say, “I forgive,"]],[1099,["because they are ignorant, they are blind,","they are not yet there where I am."]],[1105,["I am the one who is at the Source","of enjoyment,"]],[1109,["at the Source of peace and while these","are not, so I forgive.”"]],[1118,["And you’ll be amazed that this forgiveness","that Christ gives you"]],[1124,["works out vichara shaithilya, is","the relaxation of the thought."]],[1134,["Now this opposite movement, that you have","to move,"]],[1140,["first of all should start at this point,","today, from forgiving others."]],[1149,["Now what happens when you forgive someone?","That means you do not react."]],[1155,["The power to react to somebody’s injuries,","insults is finished."]],[1165,["And when that power is finished, you become","a powerful person,"]],[1170,["because nobody can now overpower you,"]],[1177,["because nobody can kill you, nobody can","hurt you,"]],[1182,["nobody can do anything to you."]],[1186,["But it is not, again I’ll say,","shamelessness."]],[1189,["You see, people can think that it is","shamelessness."]],[1195,["So if somebody says to you something harsh"]],[1201,["and something that is wrong, you do not","accept it."]],[1207,["But supposing I shout at someone,","the bhoots run away."]],[1210,["You have seen that many-a-times, I have","to shout at people,"]],[1214,["so bhoots run away because they react,","and they just run away,"]],[1218,["but the Spirit shines through."]],[1223,["So in Sahaja Yoga one has to understand","that it is just this central path,"]],[1231,["is just the balancing thing which is","important. It’s not an extreme of anything."]],[1238,["Like when we go to say that you must","forgive everyone,"]],[1242,["it’s not going to that extreme where you","have done some wrong,"]],[1247,["and somebody says to you [and] you don’t","take that part of it, it doesn’t mean that."]],[1252,["Again discretion is the engine of your","movement."]],[1257,["So you have to see that, if they have","said it,"]],[1263,["something like that, “Is it? Have I gone","against the Spirit?”"]],[1269,["Otherwise, if I say to you something, you","will say, “All right, forgive Mother!”"]],[1274,["You see the point is? “Forgive Her","for saying so.” No."]],[1281,["You cannot say that to Me!"]],[1286,["So then, that is the point [from which]","you start thinking,"]],[1294,["“Why Mother said so? What have I done?”"]],[1297,["Now think on those lines – so you start","moving again."]],[1300,["It’s a very thin road on which you have","to walk."]],[1307,["One side is the huge, big Gibraltar,","rock of Gibraltar, of your ego,"]],[1315,["the another side is a super-ego."]],[1318,["In between is a small discretion path","going,"]],[1324,["on which you have to see both the sides,"]],[1327,["whether you are hitting yourself with","the rock of Gibraltar,"]],[1332,["or falling into the valley of super-ego,"]],[1337,["you should see that you are using","your discretion."]],[1342,["So the another thing one has to remember","[is] that whatever you were doing"]],[1348,["before realisation, is to go to extremes."]],[1351,["For example now, you start some sort","of a movement."]],[1356,["Say, you say, “We’ll have classical","things!” All right."]],[1359,["Then you go so classical that it becomes","mechanical."]],[1364,["Now you’ll say, “Give up! We’ll start","anti-culture”."]],[1366,["So you go to another side that you become","primitive."]],[1370,["Till you have reached the end of it and","learnt a lesson of your life,"]],[1374,["you do not return. But in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1377,["it’s a very slippery road on which we are","walking,"]],[1382,["and there you have to see that it’s not","your ego and it is not your super-ego."]],[1388,["So discretion has to be used very much,","and the balance,"]],[1392,["in this movement, which we need not use","otherwise."]],[1399,["Till we are absolutely destroyed we can go","ahead with it, before realisation."]],[1405,["But in Sahaja Yoga, as soon as you leave","your discretion,"]],[1410,["you fall this side or that side."]],[1413,["Now those people who are of high quality"]],[1418,["Sahaja Yogis take to discretion first:","“How far to go?”"]],[1424,["Now for that Mother doesn’t have to say","because you are the Spirit."]],[1429,["You yourself, you are the Spirit. First","of all assume your position as a Spirit,"]],[1434,["and then move with it, that you see,","discreetly,"]],[1438,["how far to go, how far not to go."]],[1444,["Now that is one of the things: that you","have to become thoughtless"]],[1449,["by becoming a forgiving person."]],[1456,["Most of the thoughts will drop out once","you become forgiving."]],[1459,["But you cannot forgive some people,","like you cannot forgive God,"]],[1463,["you cannot forgive Mother. Certain things","you cannot do,"]],[1467,["so the Maryadas must be seen."]],[1472,["Now, in these boundaries if you walk","properly, you can go ahead."]],[1480,["This is the thing which brings you","vichara shaithilya"]],[1483,["or you can call – the mind becomes relaxed."]],[1490,["Then you have to have vishayatha","shaithilya:"]],[1493,["means your organs, sense organs, always","react to things,"]],[1497,["because you are human beings, you see,","you are born like that."]],[1501,["So, whatever happens you react."]],[1508,["For example, you see a beautiful flower,","you react to it."]],[1514,["Some sort of a thought rises with it."]],[1519,["Now you must practice to see something","without allowing any thought to rise,"]],[1528,["then you start sucking through your Spirit"]],[1533,["the beauty, the glory, the fragrance","of a flower."]],[1542,["Every flower is a poetry, but when you","start thinking about it"]],[1550,["then it becomes a dead thing. But you","just try to enjoy."]],[1556,["Now you are the people who are","on this earth to enjoy yourself,"]],[1564,["not to worry about anything. Just enjoy!"]],[1568,["But if you are still used to,"]],[1573,["“I must do this thing special, I am","something special Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1578,["I’m a very highly evolved Sahaja Yogi”,","then you are finished."]],[1585,["Say, we are all going in a boat, enjoy","the boat and also the waves."]],[1591,["But somebody says, “I’m a very special one,","I’ll try to jump down,”"]],[1598,["then you are back again into the same","position."]],[1603,["So one has to have an attitude","of looking at things."]],[1608,["Try to develop this habit of looking","at things without thinking about it."]],[1615,["Try to develop your mind on those lines","that you do not react."]],[1621,["Now this excitement business, or all this","sensationalisation that is today’s craze,"]],[1629,["comes from the same [source]: that","your sense organs"]],[1633,["require a kind of sensation because","they react."]],[1638,["While we must have our sense organs","which do not react,"]],[1642,["because they must only react to the Spirit."]],[1647,["So we have to develop a new type of sense","organs or a new quality of sense organs"]],[1655,["who do not react to outside excitement."]],[1662,["Now if you want Sahaja Yoga to be","excitement, how can you do it?"]],[1666,["I mean just, it is just the opposite of it."]],[1672,["So what you have to do is to see"]],[1677,["that your sense organs, say for example","your eyes,"]],[1681,["they see something then they react."]],[1686,["Your ears, they hear something [and]","they react."]],[1692,["Somebody wants to talk and see","the reaction –"]],[1700,["there are expectations (of a reaction)."]],[1705,["But because Spirit is active itself,"]],[1713,["it acts itself – you have seen vibrations","don’t speak, they act –"]],[1719,["It has the power to act, [so] you need","not react."]],[1728,["If you can reduce the power of reaction","you rise much higher."]],[1737,["This is a thing which one has to know","when now"]],[1744,["we are celebrating His resurrection:","because it is tapah,"]],[1750,["it is the penance of Christ. Christ came","on this earth for penance."]],[1755,["You know in the Gayatri mantra, there are","7 things they have said [in] it,"]],[1761,["and at the point of Christ it is tapah,","is the penance."]],[1767,["So you have to have so-called penance","to achieve the joy."]],[1773,["The penance is to pull back your sense","organs inside yourself."]],[1780,["As Krishna has said that you have","to pull back"]],[1784,["all your limbs of sense organs like","a tortoise does."]],[1794,["So the excitement that you require"]],[1801,["for your sense organs is no more needed,"]],[1808,["because your sense organs, now, are","themselves the source of excitement."]],[1819,["In the sense that they neutralise","all the excitements."]],[1828,["You go to that point from where it starts."]],[1834,["A river starts with a very small,","little drop,"]],[1838,["and then it expands, expands, expands,","expands."]],[1841,["You go to the source, absolutely","to the central point,"]],[1847,["there you’ll find hardly even a drop falling on you."]],[1853,["Another good example would be: a wheel","has the central point,"]],[1861,["and the wheel moves all the time but","the central point has to be fixed,"]],[1865,["otherwise the wheel, with the wheel","[if] that central point also moves,"]],[1871,["then the cart cannot move, [the] cart will","also start rolling down."]],[1877,["So the central point has to be fixed","otherwise the wheel cannot move."]],[1883,["So you go to that central point, and","the movement is on the central point"]],[1889,["where there is no movement, in a way,"]],[1897,["because there’s only ascent, there’s","no revolution."]],[1902,["It doesn’t revolve any more, there’s just","ascent on the central point."]],[1909,["I hope you try to understand that all","the movements come out of ignorance."]],[1916,["All the outer movements come because we are","not yet on the central point."]],[1923,["But that achievement is not difficult","because you have jumped onto it."]],[1930,["But you again come out onto the periphery,","onto the wheel."]],[1937,["So how to keep there, and to ascend","in that line?"]],[1942,["Say, for example, there are wheels","like this, wheels after wheels,"]],[1945,["but central point is fixed. Now every time","you jump out,"]],[1952,["now how do you go back to the central","point?"]],[1956,["Is by detachment, by tapah, by penance."]],[1965,["Penance is to deny."]],[1971,["It doesn’t mean asceticism of outside","but asceticism of within."]],[1981,["First of all we must learn to give,"]],[1988,["give to others."]],[1993,["That also sometimes people find it","difficult, I have seen."]],[1996,["Even to give £1, they said,"]],[1999,["for Sahaja Yoga people find it difficult.","I was amazed!"]],[2006,["So to give to others is going to be","even worse."]],[2012,["Try to give to others. Detachment."]],[2018,["So one way is to have forgiveness,"]],[2028,["then second is generosity."]],[2037,["If you work for Sahaja Yoga: “I haven’t","done anything so far”."]],[2043,["Not to react to it what work you have done."]],[2046,["“Oh, it’s pleasure, I did it. It’s my","pleasure, I did it. Just out of pleasure”."]],[2052,["Don’t count it; “I brought four flowers,","she brought two flowers."]],[2059,["I must be paid for one and a half flower.”"]],[2063,["All these calculations are on","the periphery, outside,"]],[2069,["when you were not realised souls. Now","you just don’t count anything else,"]],[2074,["but your blessings. So you be generous."]],[2081,["I have seen now people have different","attachments, subtler ones."]],[2087,["Like attached to their own children.","I have seen people [like that]."]],[2092,["Once their children are born","to Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2095,["then the whole world becomes","their children:"]],[2099,["you spoil them, you spoil yourself."]],[2103,["You are just their trustees."]],[2110,["But to you it becomes a very big thing","that you have produced a child."]],[2115,["Anybody can produce, even a dog produces","a child, what is so great?"]],[2119,["I mean, the bitch."]],[2124,["That’s a funny word to say."]],[2129,["So, to create a child is not something","great, but that you have a child"]],[2134,["in charge of you, which has to work","for God."]],[2141,["You are just in charge. But to identify","that, “This child is great,"]],[2146,["he’s a very big realised soul” and all","that, you see,"]],[2150,["will blast your head completely, because","it is subtler blasting."]],[2154,["It’s like hydrogen bomb."]],[2157,["Ordinary bombs can destroy [a] part of it,","but these subtler bombs are even worse."]],[2163,["And that will spoil the child, that will","spoil"]],[2168,["also you very much in your ascent."]],[2173,["So what you have to do is to see that","if you have a child,"]],[2177,["all right, you are just in charge,"]],[2183,["as you are in charge of all the children","of Sahaja Yogis, not [just] of your own."]],[2189,["Be generous! “Udaara charitraanam","Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam”:"]],[2194,["The person who is a generous person,","for him, the whole world is his family."]],[2199,["So expand yourself. “This is my family,","this is my wife,"]],[2205,["how can I live without my wife, or","my husband, my child, my…”"]],[2210,["This will not help you, this will tie you","down completely."]],[2216,["This is a very subtler thing you start,","because now you are receding back."]],[2222,["First you gave up your family, gave up","your children,"]],[2225,["gave up everything, came to this extreme,","now you are going back."]],[2228,["For Indians they understand that they are","already too much in it,"]],[2232,["so they know that to detach yourself from","your children"]],[2235,["is very important because they are","already in it."]],[2238,["They are too much attached to their","children."]],[2241,["In the beginning, they’ll always tell me,","“My child is like this,"]],[2244,["my mother is like this, my father is like","this, my brother is like this,"]],[2247,["improve my…” and they’ll be all bhoots,","one better than the other!"]],[2253,["Without any discretion, bring all those","relations on my head"]],[2256,["and I feel terrible about it."]],[2258,["Even a farfetched relation of a relation","of a relation of a relation"]],[2263,["they will bring it along that, “You see,","she’s my relation”."]],[2266,["So, in India it’s very important that you","are a relation of such and such person,"]],[2271,["and you may not have anything to do","with that person"]],[2273,["but he’s a relation, so “He is a relation.”"]],[2279,["So, what we understand is that","our relationships"]],[2283,["and our identifications have to be dropped","completely."]],[2290,["We are universal beings now."]],[2296,["So your child is a source of joy – every","child should be the source of joy to you,"]],[2302,["every child should be. Bachelors that way","are better,"]],[2306,["or the ones who are not yet married,","they can enjoy everybody’s child nicely."]],[2311,["But, when you are not a mother and","a father,"]],[2315,["if you are enjoying [other children],","what is so creditable?"]],[2318,["When you become the parents, and then","you enjoy other children"]],[2324,["as much as you enjoy your child, then","your generosity has started."]],[2330,["So the generosity of loving others,","the generosity through compassion."]],[2338,["Compassion doesn’t mean that you should","pity someone but compassion means"]],[2342,["the sharing of personality, sharing","of love personality."]],[2351,["And that is where we miss the point,"]],[2354,["that compassion means if somebody","has to be helped."]],[2358,["Sahaja Yoga compassion is not that,","Sahaja Yoga compassion is – it’s sharing."]],[2366,["Now the fourth thing you have to remember.","What I have told you other?"]],[2371,["First is? Is the forgiveness. First!","According to Me is first is forgiveness."]],[2381,["Second is, you can call it, the compassion,"]],[2389,["or the detachment leading to compassion."]],[2400,["So you can call it the first one","as the forgiveness,"]],[2407,["[then] detachment and thirdly","the compassion."]],[2412,["These are the wheels of your chariot which","moves you."]],[2421,["These are the wheels you should remember."]],[2425,["Now,"]],[2432,["if you go further with it, with","the detachment,"]],[2438,["supposing works out in you, even you","become compassionate, even that comes."]],[2446,["Still what is the judging point? How do you","know that you are all right?"]],[2454,["How do you measure? How do you find out","that you are all right?"]],[2463,["I mean what you call the, take the bearing,","as they say, of the ship."]],[2468,["How do you know? You must have peace,","you should be a peaceful person."]],[2481,["Agitation should be outside,"]],[2487,["but you should be absolutely peaceful","person."]],[2491,["If you are not a peaceful person,","then be sure"]],[2495,["that you are not yet there where you should","have been."]],[2500,["Now you can say that, “Christ also got","very angry,"]],[2508,["Hhe took a whip in His hand and beat","the people, so we can also do the same.”"]],[2515,["You are not Christ. You are not","an incarnation,"]],[2518,["you must know, you are a realised soul."]],[2523,["So you don’t have to take a whip in your","hand and hit others. You cannot."]],[2528,["This is the mistake what the disciples","of Mohammad Sahib have done,"]],[2532,["that they never thought that He was","an incarnation, you see."]],[2535,["All the incarnations have killed. Krishna","has killed, Rama has killed,"]],[2542,["Devi has killed. But you are not the Devi!"]],[2547,["You are not Shri Krishna! So you don’t have","to kill anyone."]],[2553,["You don’t have to show the temper.","So if you still have a temper"]],[2558,["then know that your progress is very slow.","You have to be a peaceful person."]],[2565,["Imagine Sahaja Yogis having a Jihad.","What do you say to that?"]],[2569,["Going with swords in the hand and a spear","in the hand and hitting others."]],[2579,["This point I want to make very clear","because when I am there,"]],[2583,["of course, I am going to tell you everyone,","but when I am not there"]],[2587,["I don’t want you to take in your hands","the swords and things and fight."]],[2599,["What William Blake has written is","for the incarnation."]],[2602,["The Incarnations say, “Give me my…”"]],[2606,["It’s not that you should say now,","“Give me Rama’s Ayudhas.”"]],[2612,["You cannot use. You are not an incarnation."]],[2616,["Because the discretion of these are","effective – yours are not."]],[2628,["So you are not to take any weapon","into your hand or even anger."]],[2637,["Doesn’t behove a Sahaja Yogi at any point,","unless and until I tell you to be angry."]],[2647,["So this is the criteria, that you have to be","a peaceful person, not aggressive person."]],[2657,["Now different people have different type","of aggressiveness."]],[2661,["For example, men would start… men don’t","discuss, you see,"]],[2664,["they just slap you – finished. They","don't argue, they don’t like to argue,"]],[2668,["at a point they’ll go and they’ll just","hit you out and finished."]],[2672,["But women are very good at argument,","and very aggressive,"]],[2678,["very aggressively argumentative. So you","don’t argue: is the second point."]],[2686,["If you are argumentative then know that you","are not yet there where you have to be."]],[2693,["A peaceful person goes to a point and then","argues it out."]],[2698,["If you are argumentative then your progress","is not all right."]],[2707,["So a person has to be absolutely peaceful"]],[2715,["and this peace is the most effective thing.","We are seeking the peace of the universe:"]],[2722,["you cannot achieve it through any one","of these bombs,"]],[2728,["you can only achieve it through the Spirit","which is the source of all the peace."]],[2738,["So, I would request all of you to give up","tempers, angers."]],[2744,["Peace is the greatest powerful thing","on this earth."]],[2750,["There’s a story, a Chinese story,","interesting, about it."]],[2753,["There were two very great fighting cocks,","you see, known to be the greatest of all."]],[2761,["And they have this, you see, excitement","again of the cock-fighting in China."]],[2767,["I mean, you can have of everything in this","world, all absurd things,"]],[2771,["like rugby, football, this, that, I mean,","there’s no end to it!"]],[2776,["So these, these two cocks were to go in for","an international sort of a fight, I think."]],[2787,["So they said, “There is one great saint","living here,"]],[2790,["he makes everyone very powerful.”","So the owner of the cocks went to him"]],[2795,["and he said, “Will you make my these","two cocks very powerful,"]],[2799,["so that they can fight, they can fight","and win?”"]],[2804,["He said, “All right, it’s very simple.","All right, you leave them with me.”"]],[2810,["So after a month when he appeared","to take the cocks,"]],[2814,["they would not react to anything, they","were just standing like this, watching."]],[2819,["He got a fright of his life, he said,","“How are they going to fight?”"]],[2821,["He said, “You just take them, you’ll see.”"]],[2825,["So he took them to the arena and put them","there,"]],[2830,["and all the cocks, you see, invaded","each other, fought."]],[2834,["These they were just watching, these two","were watching!"]],[2839,["And all the rest of them got so frightened","with these two, they all ran away -"]],[2843,["and they won!"]],[2848,["So the person who is peaceful is","the powerful [one]."]],[2854,["The one who does not react to anything","else, is the most powerful."]],[2864,["So, one has to understand that peace","is the criteria to know"]],[2870,["that you are absolutely at that point","where you have to be."]],[2879,["But peace by no chance means cowardliness."]],[2882,["Because, you see, I know what indiscretion","is, human indiscretion."]],[2886,["They think then cowardliness. No. You stand","like this - not like this."]],[2893,["The difference between a peaceful person","and a cowardly person is"]],[2897,["that a cowardly person acts to the negative","forces,"]],[2902,["and a peaceful person creates positive","forces, constructive forces."]],[2908,["Generates it."]],[2915,["So you are not to be cowardly, but you","have to be peaceful."]],[2919,["And a peaceful person is like a magnet,","you see, so soothing it is."]],[2925,["So you can see now we are moving towards","the soothing qualities of the Spirit."]],[2932,["We have to soothe others, and not","to excite, but to soothe."]],[2938,["And that soothing quality, what you call,","is, we call it like the ghee:"]],[2949,["when the body is charred and is absolutely","burning,"]],[2955,["then you put some sort of a ghee on it","so it becomes smooth,"]],[2965,["like lubrication, [a] lubricant. Such","a personality is a lubricant."]],[2974,["It doesn’t go into friction, but reduces","frictions."]],[2981,["It’s a lubricant temperament."]],[2984,["So you should judge yourself, “Am I","a lubricant personality?”"]],[2988,["For example, you see two persons","are fighting, all right?"]],[2994,["And one goes as a peace-maker;"]],[2999,["and one goes to excite it more, you see,","he joins them."]],[3003,["Now the one who is the peacemaker","is the blessed one,"]],[3006,["is the one who is the one moving towards","God because he is the peacemaker."]],[3015,["“Blessed are those who are","the peacemakers.”"]],[3020,["All these things if you see are, what I am","telling today is the same –"]],[3023,["but in a different language, that’s all –","what Christ said it."]],[3027,["To understand Christ you have to open","Him out more,"]],[3030,["because He said it in very simple words,","which has very deep meanings"]],[3035,["and only a Sahaja Yogi can understand Him."]],[3041,["So you have to make peace."]],[3045,["I have seen people been given Nobel prizes","of peace, who have no peace within at all."]],[3051,["They are hot-tempered, horrible people and","given Nobel prize for peace! All right."]],[3058,["And personified temper, absolutely","hot-tempered; and you call it peace!"]],[3064,["How can you have peace with a person","who is so hot-tempered?"]],[3069,["So this is possible. In this human","endeavour anything is possible, you see."]],[3075,["It’s sometimes so absurd, you see."]],[3079,["Like I have seen people getting a degree,","“doctorate of learning”,"]],[3086,["who has not even been to a school, who","doesn’t know how to read the book!"]],[3091,["Anything is possible because it is just","a maneuvering of everything,"]],[3096,["it’s so artificial."]],[3102,["So the lubrication of your love, the love."]],[3115,["So the love that you enjoy is not what","is bestowed upon you,"]],[3118,["but what you bestow upon others."]],[3123,["The idea of love is also funny."]],[3126,["It’s just the opposite of what you have","seen so far."]],[3133,["They’ll write, “I love you”, all right?"]],[3136,["And the second sentence will be,","“I want to divorce you.”"]],[3143,["And the modern fashion is like that.","“I love you;"]],[3146,["I want to divorce you because I love you","too much!”"]],[3157,["“Because I want to spare you!” Is very","modern, very sophisticated it is."]],[3168,["So the love that hurts others, love that","tortures others,"]],[3175,["the love that expects, is not love."]],[3179,["Love that just flows, just forgives,","is just compassion,"]],[3186,["is the most enjoyable thing."]],[3191,["Radiant, just like the sunshine,","like Christ"]],[3196,["who even forgave those who crucified Him!","Imagine! Imagine!"]],[3207,["Because He knew that God will not forgive.","Even God will not forgive those –"]],[3212,["He tried to forgive them."]],[3220,["But we, those who call themselves","Christians,"]],[3223,["those who are supposed to be Christians","are just the opposite of Christ,"]],[3227,["just the opposite in every way, if you see,","just the opposite."]],[3235,["So, you come to a point where you","understand that you become the love."]],[3243,["And when it is pure love relationships,"]],[3247,["then there is no lust and greed or","anything, but just love and purity of love."]],[3255,["You don’t want to do it  because you","want to have"]],[3262,["any lust out of that person. Just see,","the opposite."]],[3266,["Here the girl is very ‘attractive’. What is","so attractive?"]],[3272,["They, to my eyes they look like mosquitoes;","Horrible! Sometimes like witches, you know."]],[3280,["Their nails and all that look like, to me,","like witches: so artificial."]],[3285,["Just like machines, sometimes."]],[3288,["What is so attractive in these women?","Or in these men? You see."]],[3293,["They look like skulls to me, sometimes and","sometimes like, Frankenstein"]],[3298,["I don’t know what they look like, horrible.","The way they walk,"]],[3303,["the way they try to impress. I mean,","nothing but fear comes out of them."]],[3308,["So, what you emit out of your love","to others"]],[3313,["[is] a sense of security, an ocean","of security you can call it."]],[3320,["Everyone feels secured, secured with you."]],[3326,["And that security will be felt by you."]],[3333,["Trust, trust others. You must trust.","That is very important."]],[3341,["Trust for everything. I have seen some","people are very serious on money,"]],[3346,["some are very serious about possessions,","some are this. I know they…"]],[3352,["they are sometimes weak people."]],[3357,["Could be weak about money, could be","weak about possessions,"]],[3360,["could be even insulting to things that","should not be so:"]],[3365,["but don’t lose your temper, just have","forgiveness for them,"]],[3372,["and let them feel secured, absolutely","secured. Trust."]],[3378,["You see, as you know that I never ask","the trustees to give me any reports."]],[3383,["I do not ask them to give me any – what you","call - the accounts or anything."]],[3388,["I don’t understand accounts at all myself,","you see."]],[3391,["So I never see how many accounts you","have got, what money you have got"]],[3395,["or, say, supposing Gavin is saying that,","“I am sending money now, Mother, to you,”"]],[3398,["whatever I receive, iIt’s all right –","finished."]],[3401,["I don’t know whether he gives you","receipts or not, nothing."]],[3403,["If he says so [it’s] all right. I leave it","to him."]],[3406,["He has to grow, whatever it is. It is","his responsibility,"]],[3409,["if he’s not grown up enough he’ll grow.","So trust others because in Sahaja Yoga"]],[3414,["you must know we are all growing, we are","all transforming."]],[3418,["So we must grow, we must grow","and for growth"]],[3422,["security is the most important thing."]],[3426,["If there is no security for a tree it will","never grow."]],[3431,["So everybody should feel secured","in the company of Sahaja Yogis."]],[3439,["If there is any insecurity from someone","then it should be reported"]],[3445,["to the collective and [you] should see that","all such cases of insecurity creating,"]],[3451,["trouble creators should be, little bit,","taken out for the time being."]],[3457,["Because there should be a healthy growth."]],[3459,["But growth must take place and for that","you must trust."]],[3463,["Somebody might make mistakes – all right,","doesn’t matter."]],[3466,["Somebody may be dishonest – doesn’t matter.","But give them security."]],[3473,["But what we do is to give security","to bhoots, I have seen, [it’s] very common."]],[3477,["People will have only interest","in the bhootish people."]],[3482,["They will trust a bhootish people than to","trust a person who is a little dishonest."]],[3486,["Doesn’t matter. You see, what is","dishonesty?"]],[3489,["Supposing somebody doesn’t give income","tax, doesn’t matter,"]],[3491,["it is this government, or it’s that","government. What does it matter to us?"]],[3495,["As long as that person is honest to God","it’s sufficient."]],[3499,["Our honesty is of a different level. So we","become angry with that person,"]],[3504,["we get upset with that person. There’s","nothing to get angry."]],[3509,["Actually my system as you know is that","I know also that people"]],[3513,["who have mismanaged money, who have","not been all right, I know it, somehow,"]],[3518,["without knowing accounts. But I said,","“Just forgive, forgive, forgive”."]],[3522,["I know everything but I just say,","“Forgive, doesn’t matter.”"]],[3528,["Then, you might say, with rationality,","that, “Mother, such a person"]],[3531,["will go ahead with it”. No he won’t!","You try and trust."]],[3536,["Why? Because they are growing, they are","coming to light"]],[3542,["and the more light they see the better they","become. This trust has to be there."]],[3550,["Trusting in God that He will give him","the right path."]],[3558,["So this understanding about your growth"]],[3566,["is within yourself, which you can see."]],[3572,["And the highest of all is the collectivity."]],[3576,["Not the fraternity of bhoots, but","collectivity."]],[3580,["Again discretion has to be used – how far","you are collective."]],[3589,["If a person thinks he is a very great","person and he can correct everyone"]],[3592,["and he can punish everyone and do","as he likes, then he is not collective."]],[3598,["But sometimes you have to also understand","that even with bhootish people"]],[3603,["I have to stoop down to conquer them,","to bring them up."]],[3611,["Don’t become like them, try to elevate them","than to go down to their level."]],[3619,["And if you can manage that, then you have","achieved"]],[3623,["what you wanted to do through","your collectivity."]],[3628,["And a person has to be collective. If he is","not collective"]],[3632,["then one must know that there’s something","definitely wrong with that person."]],[3642,["Then what you have to do after detachment","from things [is] the penance part of it."]],[3652,["For this we have to be doing some penance."]],[3656,["For example if you are too much attached","to anything: say you are fond of food."]],[3660,["Many people are, I know that. The tongue","is the worst of all."]],[3665,["If you can control tongue you have","controlled at least 50%"]],[3668,["of your sense organs. If you are attached","to the tongue [you should say,]"]],[3672,["“These days I am going into a big penance,","I am eating just boiled food"]],[3676,["without salt, without anything in it,","just boiled food. Going into penance."]],[3681,["I have to! For 9 months.”"]],[3686,["For me it doesn’t matter. It’s no penance","for me because I’ve no tongue at all,"]],[3691,["no taste buds, [so] I can manage.","So whatever you like too much,"]],[3696,["“Ahaa! I love to have something.” You see,","specially here I’ve seen"]],[3700,["if you see good food or anything – “Mmmm…”"]],[3707,["Now, it’s as cold as ice. Should I have it?","I can if you want,"]],[3713,["but it’s rather cold, I think you would","like to give me hot. All right."]],[3717,["I don’t mind having it. All right."]],[3720,["So now what you have to do is have a kind","of self-directed discipline."]],[3733,["Self-directed. Not on others.","Self-directed."]],[3741,["“Do I meditate in the morning? I don’t.","So what’s wrong with me?"]],[3746,["I’m supposed to be a Sahaja Yogi.”"]],[3751,["Don’t have - nobody has to tell you.","You yourself should do this to yourself."]],[3758,["You are fond of food? “All right, doesn’t","matter, I’ll fast for two days”."]],[3762,["No fasting is allowed in Sahaja Yoga,","all right,"]],[3764,["but fasting for detachment is all right,"]],[3767,["not for God’s Sake, but for your sake","you do it."]],[3771,["“I like a particular type of cake.","All right, I’ll not have it."]],[3776,["I’ll not have it for one year”. But no,","people have to give up,"]],[3779,["then they’ll give up something like","Rhubarb! [a bitter vegetable]"]],[3791,["So one should not be cunning about it, you","see, should not be cunning with yourself."]],[3796,["So what you have to do is to see that,"]],[3798,["“Where does this mind go? What is","the attraction?”"]],[3803,["I mean, even now, I find some people are","like Romeo - Juliets, you see,"]],[3807,["still living in that area of Romeo Juliet-","ness. Get out of it! [It’s] Nonsense."]],[3817,["Get out of that kind of a thing. That","doesn’t mean you become [a] dry personality"]],[3822,["of another extreme, can be, that you just","become like sticks, that’s not the point."]],[3827,["But you should not indulge into","these things."]],[3833,["These are all artificial things."]],[3836,["So a tapah is to be established within","yourself. Self-discipline."]],[3842,["Now those who talk too much should stop","talking, absolutely mauna is the ilaaj."]],[3847,["Mauna is the treatment for such people.","Just don’t talk!"]],[3852,["Those who do not talk, most of the English","men don’t talk, women talk too much."]],[3859,["It’s a fact. I’ve seen – any interview,","you see, the woman will talk first."]],[3864,["This [police] constable lady died, [and]","her mother was talking!"]],[3866,["In India a mother would not be","in a position to talk, you know."]],[3869,["The father was sitting quietly. You just","can’t imagine."]],[3872,["In India supposing a child dies like that,","you see,"]],[3875,["the mother would be absolutely sobbing,","in a mess, she won’t be talking."]],[3879,["Here the woman was talking, we were","so surprised!"]],[3882,["You see, the women talk too much [here],"]],[3885,["men just don’t talk, they are not supposed","to talk, I think, they just keep quiet."]],[3891,["At the most they might be slapping.","I don’t know what they do."]],[3897,["So what we have to do is to teach ourselves"]],[3901,["that, if our tongue talks too much, then we","better keep quiet."]],[3906,["If we do not talk, we better talk, we","should teach ourselves how to talk."]],[3911,["Now go and talk to the sea, go and talk","to some tree,"]],[3914,["go and talk to someone like that. Or best","is to talk to me, to my photograph."]],[3922,["So that’s how you achieve a kind","of a control over your tongue."]],[3928,["To talk sweetly. Some people have to go","through penance for that."]],[3933,["For them to talk sweetly is like taking","rhubarb again"]],[3941,["They just can’t talk sweetly, just can’t.","Sarcasm."]],[3946,["You see, in that sarcasm they have","a special pleasure."]],[3955,["Try to say something sweetly. You can be","humorous without being sarcastic."]],[3961,["Humour is the best way. What is the need","to be sarcastic?"]],[3965,["There’s no need at all. Is a sign","of cowardliness, I think, sarcasm,"]],[3969,["is a sign that you want to hurt others,","but you are not straightforward."]],[3973,["So try to avoid sarcastic talking."]],[3976,["If you are sarcastic, better tell your","tongue to behave itself."]],[3982,["So, little disciplining towards yourself,","punishment what you call,"]],[3987,["or the tapah, the penance has to work out."]],[3991,["Now people have so many ways of, you see,","seeing things."]],[3995,["Some men want to see women all the time,","some women want to see men all the time"]],[4000,["or clothes or anything, you see.","Now, the difference is that"]],[4004,["when you see something, it reacts."]],[4008,["The difference between my looking","at anything is that, that reacts."]],[4019,["When I look at you, your Kundalini reacts,","when I look at this, it gets vibrated."]],[4024,["Kataksha, kataksha: Every eye… -","Kataksha, what is… -"]],[4032,["every glance, every glance"]],[4038,["makes the thing react. And nirikshana","means, I know what it is."]],[4044,["I know what it is. Just looking at a person","I know what it is."]],[4047,["Looking at a thing, I know what it is -","nirikshana."]],[4051,["And the whole thing is in the memory","there, you see."]],[4054,["Like, we were going and they said","we have only black stones."]],[4058,["I said, “No, you have red also.” He said,","“Where do you know?”"]],[4061,["So I told them [the] exact spot where","to get the red stones."]],[4063,["They said, “How do you know, Mother?”","I said, “We passed that way"]],[4066,["about eight days back and I know there","are red stones.”"]],[4069,["So everything I see gets vibrated and also","I note"]],[4076,["what is there, and is all ready there to be","used at a proper time."]],[4085,["But what do I do? What do I do?","I do nothing."]],[4094,["I do nothing. I don’t think, I don’t plan.","Everything that you do, I don’t do."]],[4106,["So when you have that kind of a temperament","you’ll be amazed,"]],[4115,["the amount of dynamism that will work","it out."]],[4118,["You don’t have to create a dynamo, it’s","inside you. Let it work it out."]],[4126,["Today I had told Gavin that I won’t have","so much of a puja but I’ll talk."]],[4130,["Because puja is all right, it talks","for itself and this thing."]],[4134,["But I wanted to talk to you because now","the time has come for us to go further."]],[4140,["As a result of all this, all this, that","when you do [it],"]],[4145,["you become the Truth, you become the Truth."]],[4153,["So, in every chakra if you concentrate,","and use the chakra"]],[4158,["to detach yourself from the particular","quality of that chakra."]],[4164,["Like, now for example, the Nabhi chakra","does the digestion."]],[4171,["Now you don’t worry what you should","eat to digest."]],[4176,["Just detach yourself from there, with","vibrations, if you just see and eat"]],[4181,["whatever is there, you will digest."]],[4188,["And then you become the Truth. Truth","that is love, that is God."]],[4194,["May God Bless you all."]]]);
